     "receiptDescription": "KELL SMACKS",
     "romanceDescription": "<p>Wake up to a bowl of Kellogg’s® Honey Smacks® cereal and bring tasty honey flavor and the wholesomeness of wheat to your breakfast table. Each sweetened wheat puff is made with a touch of real honey, giving you a glazed and crispy crunch in every spoonful. You’ll love this classic cereal - dig 'em at breakfast time with your favorite milk or at snack time. Made with whole grain and crafted with colors from natural sources, Kellogg’s® Honey Smacks® delivers our best in every bite. Enjoy them before school, as a crispy homework snack, during slow weekend mornings, or packed up for on the go road trip snacks. Whether you enjoy it with milk or straight from the box, it’s an easy part of breakfast or snacks that the whole family will love. Start your day with this delicious cereal - it's Honey Smackin' Good!</p><ul><li>CRISPY PUFFS: A cereal you can dig, these wheat puffs are made with touch of real honey that the whole family will love</li><li>BEST IN EVERY BITE: Made with whole grain, you can feel good about this cereal; each serving contains the wholesomeness of wheat</li><li>HONEY SMACKIN' GOOD: The glazed crunch of this puffed wheat cereal is unmistakably delicious; Colors from natural sources</li><li>DIG 'EM ANYTIME: Enjoy with milk before school, munch during homework, in weekends, or pack up a bag for the lunch box backpack</li><li>WHAT YOU GET: Includes one 16.3 oz large size box of Kellogg’s® Honey Smacks® breakfast cereal; Shelf stable; Instant and ready to eat</li></ul>",
